{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act45side_level_act45side_01_end",
  "groupId": "act45side",
  "stageId": "act45side_01",
  "title": "花格窗边的梦想",
  "storyCode": "SS-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "4a897a0853c1539e2d9aeaf648258bd713fb2683278e8a60e4479a406f246665",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "欢迎来到梦城堡，我是这里的现任主人，莫菲丝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "梦城堡......的主人......不对，你做了什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "和你梦里演的一样啊？只不过是让你们做了一个梦罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉——不过你的梦实在太无趣了，尽是些无聊的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（小声）还有那两个......讨厌的家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你认识爱丽丝......还有贝娜？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不熟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她们不是梦里的角色，是真实存在的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我倒希望她们只存在在梦里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你能不能别老提那两个家伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在和我说话欸！现在我才是这里的主人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "快让我离开这里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那不可能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最近都没什么孩子来梦城堡了，我怎么可能随便放你走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡尔顿们又不能说话，沃尔夫只有一个，而且现在说话还说不顺溜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡尔顿们",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（失落的哼唧声）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃尔夫",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱、抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你是因为自己太无聊了，所以才把我关在这个城堡里的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不要说得好像我来者不拒一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的经历都很有意思——记忆里的那些经历，还有那些陌生的场景，我反复研究了很多遍呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你偷看了我的记忆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那个家伙没有和你说过吗？了解孩子们的过去，也是塑造梦境很重要的一部分。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你确实是个例外......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "明明经历了那么多无法忘却的事情，脑子却还是一如既往地清醒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "为了弥补这个小小的遗憾，我愿意为你重新塑造一个美梦。正好我们现在面对面，你可以和我说说——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沉溺在梦境和过往的痛苦中，都是懦弱的表现。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵，你还真是嘴硬！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果按照你说的，没法直面现实的人全都是懦夫的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那这样的人，真的很多呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "帷幕渐渐拉开，座椅从台下缓缓升起。\n而座椅上坐着的，是祥子再熟悉不过的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "初华......睦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "祐天寺......还有八幡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......大家怎么都睡着了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "周围的一切如舞台布景一般。\n沉睡的少女们，就是巨大布景中安眠的人偶。\n无声，无息。\n祥子一遍遍地尝试唤醒自己的同伴，可无济于事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别白费力气了——没用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我对自己的能力还是很有信心的。她们正沉浸在自己的美梦里，你叫不醒她们的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "在我为你们塑造的梦境里有什么不好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "罗德岛的朋友们都相信你，这样不好吗？没有任何你不想看到的别离，你也不用隐藏自己 。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看看她们，难道你要说她们都是懦夫吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然我有办法从你的梦中醒来，她们也一定可以......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "突然，祥子感到几股巨大的拉力拽住了自己，等她反应过来时，她的四肢已经被丝线牢牢捆住。\n无法控制身体的紧张感瞬间侵占了她的思维，她努力地想要保持冷静。\n然而，紧绷的丝线将她身上一切微弱的抖动毫无保留地放大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你这嘴硬的家伙，就不能承认梦境是美好的吗！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子努力想办法让自己的呼吸变得平顺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你......似乎对自己的能力很自信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "也许在我之前，你的梦境从没有被人打破过。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "当然！我本来就是这个城堡里最擅长造梦的仙女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你的苏醒，只不过是一个意外。再来一次肯定就没问题了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "祥子清楚地看到，莫菲丝说出最后那几个字时，表情是咬牙切齿的，可转眼间，她的表情又变得无比天真灿烂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯......丰川祥子，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然你这么自信，那我就跟你打个赌！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......打赌？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯！绝对公平的打赌哦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "眼前的对手越是露出孩童般的微笑，就越显得无比危险。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，很简单！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "虽然那孩子绕着舞台转着圈，但祥子很清楚她肯定一直在盯着自己。并且，黑暗中还有无数双眼睛也在紧盯着自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会邀请你进入她们每一个人的梦境，给你唤醒她们的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你可以认识她们，了解她们，看看她们到底在梦境中过着怎样的生活。如果你能让她们像你一样醒来，我就让你们离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果你失败了，那么她们就得永远留在梦境里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......我会把她们都叫醒的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ave{@nbs}Mujica缺少了任何一个人，我都不会离开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "她们每个人都是我挑选出来的、最好的成员。我不会让她们任何一个人受你的摆布。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈，那可不一定。如果你失败了，你也得重新进入我为你造的梦境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "这次你一定不会再醒过来的。我会让你忘记以前的一切痛苦，自愿活在里面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "怎么样？还是说，你想收回之前说的那些大话了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就算我现在拒绝，你也不可能放我走吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哈哈！你倒是挺聪明嘛！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "丰川祥子，我很期待你在她们的梦境里，露出绝望又无助的表情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我会向你证明——你逃不掉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "莫菲丝手指轻动，祥子的视线顿时变得模糊不清。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唔——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "五颜六色、变异扭曲的光影涌入祥子的脑海中。\n舞台下喧闹欢呼的人群。\n雨夜中的一抹黑影。\n坐在椅子上的孤独少女。\n还有无数个无法分清的人影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "莫菲丝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "享受我为你们而造的美梦吧——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "川流不息的车辆，高耸入云的建筑，还有无处不在的霓虹灯牌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我从梦境里出来了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不对......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卖力的商贩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "新鲜出锅的鳞丸啊——快来看看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "匆忙的行人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "搞快点咯，后面人都等着呢！活动要迟到了啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "干练的快递员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你好！你的货——人不在家？那我放门口可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "现代的建筑，动物的耳朵......这里究竟是哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "名为“鳞丸”的小吃包装上，印着“龙门传统手作”。\n行人搭乘的载具涂着硕大的“龙门交通”标志，从眼前疾驰而过。\n干练的小哥衣服上的公司名称，同样以“龙门”开头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "丰川祥子",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "龙门......这里究竟是谁的梦境？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一个熟悉的声音从祥子头顶上传来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "晚上好喵呣喵呣~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麦",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "粉丝朋友们好呀，我是新人演员若麦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麦",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我最新主演的电影《少女鼓手》已经上映咯，希望大家可以多去影院支持若麦呢~"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菲林群众",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "凌晨三点！彻夜难眠！超想吃鳞丸怎么办？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "祐天寺若麦",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那当然是吃“喵速达”鳞丸啦！"
